## Performance e Relazioni

### Eager Loading OBBLIGATORIO
```php
protected function getRelatedData(): Collection
{
    return $this->getDoctor()
        ->studios()
        ->with(['address', 'doctors']) // Evita N+1
        ->withPivot(['is_primary', 'created_at'])
        ->orderBy('studio_user.is_primary', 'desc')
        ->get();
}
```

### Caching Strategy
```php
protected function getCachedData(string $key, callable $callback): mixed
{
    $cacheKey = sprintf('widget.%s.%s.%s', 
        static::class, 
        auth()->id(), 
        $key
    );
    
    return Cache::remember($cacheKey, 300, $callback);
}
```

## Error Handling Robusto

### Pattern Graceful Degradation
```php
protected function getViewData(): array
{
    try {
        $data = $this->fetchPrimaryData();
        
        return [
            'status' => 'success',
            'data' => $data,
            'hasData' => !empty($data),
        ];
        
    } catch (\Exception $e) {
        Log::error('Widget error', [
            'widget' => static::class,
            'error' => $e->getMessage(),
        ]);
        
        return [
            'status' => 'error',
            'data' => [],
            'hasData' => false,
            'errorMessage' => __('saluteora::widgets.common.error'),
        ];
    }
}
```

